OL,3,AHMV to close Oxford Street store after
OL,4,Athree years
OL,5,
OL,6,FHMV has said it will shut its flagship
OL,7,FOxford Street store three years after
OL,8,Fit reopened the site, blaming a
OL,9,Fproposed doubling of the rent for the
OL,10,Fclosure.
OL,12,FThe entertainment chain said it would
OL,13,Fleave the shop in March 2027, in a move
OL,14,Faffecting more than 50 staff.
OL,16,FIt said it was looking for a new site
OL,17,Fin London's West End district for its
OL,18,Fflagship shop and said it planned to
OL,19,Fmaintain a "significant presence" in
OL,20,Fthe capital.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
